Drum & Dance Day - RHYTHM CULTURE presents  
DRUM & DANCE  
Up SKILLS pD  
SERIES

Drum & Dance Day Saturday 25th February. Have you been drumming and dancing for a while and feel you have plateaued? Want to bust out a new move or learn to shred your first djembe solo?

Rhythm Culture presents DRUM & DANCE Up SKILLS pD series to give you the skills and confidence to take your dancing and drumming to the next level.

These drum and dance sessions will play on vital skills and performance development so you can take that solo you have always wanted to, understand the underlying polyrhythms and feels, or just feel "in the groove" when you drum and dance.

You can book your ticket [here](/product/casual-drum-dance-classes/).

Saturday February 25th  
1.30pm African Dance Up SKILL  
2.30pm African Drumming Up SKILL  
Palmwoods Memorial Hall  
Booking essential  
